World "RealIneq"
Title "Inequalities in ℝ"

Introduction "
The rules for inequalities you proved for `ℚ` now come to `ℝ`.
Then the rules for `abs`, and the Archimedean property: no real is above all naturals.
"

Conclusion "
You can now compute with inequalities in `ℝ`. Next: limits of sequences of reals.
"
